  "method": "Read-only baseline Git blobs, original design, actual CF3/MC2 sidecar diagnostics and three actual native PNGs. Static rectangle arithmetic only; no browser, renderer, simulator or test executed by this review.",
  "rootCause": [
    "The legacy core caption changes its semantic anchor by worldY−32, placing fission text across player head/body and brood text inside core/aim/weakpoint reserves.",
    "SceneLabels initial offsets are only horizontal half measured text width+24 and at most2 rows vertically. Every ordinary local candidate in these samples still overlaps a protected area, so essential labels jump directly to viewport rails. This is a candidate-generation gap, not proof no nearby readable position exists.",
    "Obstruction cost has no distance term; first zero-cost rail wins. fallback=true/conflicted=false can therefore place required text hundreds of pixels from its hazard while all count-based checks appear healthy.",
    "Leader length is capped at56px and clipped by blockers, so screen-top labels cannot form a complete visual link back to a distant ring. Previous fallback offsets may keep nearby rail positioning while the camera moves; the local stage is still tried first each frame."
  ],
  "designBasis": [
    {
      "path": "DesignDoc_v1.3/ViralInvasion_ArtDirection_VisualAcceptance_v1.3.md",
      "line": 110,
      "text": "最高视觉优先级：玩家位置 → 致命危险 → 病毒弱点/当前目标 → 关键效果 → 场景氛围。"
    },
    {
      "path": "DesignDoc_v1.3/ViralInvasion_ArtDirection_VisualAcceptance_v1.3.md",
      "line": 118,
      "text": "高危险同时使用轮廓、计时与方向。"
    },
    {
      "path": "DesignDoc_v1.3/ViralInvasion_ArtDirection_VisualAcceptance_v1.3.md",
      "line": 119,
      "text": "战斗内信息必须能用短句理解，避免信息被浮动伤害数字淹没。"
    },
    {
      "path": "DesignDoc_v1.3/ViralInvasion_ArtDirection_VisualAcceptance_v1.3.md",
      "line": 142,
      "id": "VIS-07",
      "text": "危险、弱点、扫描与治疗至少两种非颜色信号；高光和粒子不过度盖住关键角色/预警。"
    },
    {
      "path": "DesignDoc_v1.3/ViralInvasion_ArtDirection_VisualAcceptance_v1.3.md",
      "line": 145,
      "id": "VIS-10",
      "text": "实时HUD在1366×768与1920×1080下不遮挡关键可射击区域，缩放后布局/提示可读。"
    }
  ],
